                          ></path>
                        </svg>
                        <span>13 ottobre 2011</span>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </a>

              <a
                href="/documents/parrocchia/01-09-2011 - Leonessa e il suo santo.pdf"
                class="block bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-blue-100 rounded-xl p-6 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group border border-gray-200"
                target="_blank"
              >
                <div class="flex items-start space-x-4">
